# WayX ID: AD0342
# Name: YouTube去广告
# Description: 移除YouTube视频、瀑布流、搜索和Shorts中的广告，移除底栏的Shorts按钮和上传按钮，增加画中画及字幕翻译功能。移除YouTube Music底栏的上传、选段和升级按钮，增加歌词翻译，支持二者的后台播放。此插件需要启用MitM over HTTP/2和QUIC回退保护。支持Premium订阅用户使用，不支持tvOS设备。
# Open URL: https://apps.apple.com/app/id544007664
# Author: Maasea[https://github.com/Maasea], VirgilClyne[https://github.com/VirgilClyne], Choler[https://github.com/Choler], DivineEngine[https://github.com/DivineEngine], app2smile[https://github.com/app2smile]
# Tags: 去广告
# Platform: iOS, iPadOS, macOS
# System Version: 15
# Homepage: https://hub.kelee.one
# Icon: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/luestr/IconResource/main/App_icon/120px/YouTube.png
# Updated: 2026-10-02 13:57:49

# Updated: 2026-10-02 13:57:49
# Converted by: chance
# Category: 去广告
# Source: https://kelee.one/Tool/Loon/Lpx/YouTube_remove_ads.lpx

# [filter_local]

# [rewrite_local]
# YouTube去广告
(?i)^https:\/\/youtubei\.googleapis\.com\/(youtubei\/v1\/(browse|next|player|search|reel\/reel_watch_sequence|guide|account\/get_setting|get_watch|log_event|config))(\?(.*))?$ url script-response-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuemingDC/WayX/main/Adblock/Quantumult%20X/Kelee/YouTube_remove_ads/YouTube_remove_ads_response.js

# 请求初始化
(?i)^https?:\/\/[\w-]+\.googlevideo\.com\/initplayback.+&ack.* url script-request-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuemingDC/WayX/main/Adblock/Quantumult%20X/Kelee/YouTube_remove_ads/YouTube_remove_ads_request.js

# 请求日志事件
(?i)^https:\/\/youtubei\.googleapis\.com\/youtubei\/v1\/log_event url script-request-body https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuemingDC/WayX/main/Adblock/Quantumult%20X/Kelee/YouTube_remove_ads/YouTube_remove_ads_request.js

# [mitm]
hostname = *.googlevideo.com, youtubei.googleapis.com
